# THE PLOUGHSHARE (the snowfield plough's core on the hands): a dodge taken
# across a charging machine's line while its bite is coming turns it off the
# share. The glove rings on its flank, rime sprays along its way, and it is
# carried on past, spent (tests/gear/test_ploughshare.gd measures it).
#   tools/tour.sh tours/ploughshare.tour --seed=1 --hour=11 --weather=clear:0 --fit=mitts_corded,mod_ploughshare
coast calm
place open_coast
zoom 11
wait 1.0
spawn harvester
# A worker minds its round until it is struck: rouse it, then step across it.
walkto mob 1.5
tap swing
try 8
await tell 6
hold move_up
tap dodge
wait 0.05
release move_up
await share_turned 1.2
end
shot 01-a-charge-turned-off-the-share with mob:harvester
wait 1.4
shot 02-carried-on-past-spent with mob:harvester
